{
  "contentId": "1230713162",
  "title": "圣诞节管控标准",
  "body": "<table data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-29ec255c-7147-4736-911f-7713afeae349\"><tbody><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-OtPcTxfA\"><th data-colwidth=\"83\" width=\"83\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-026734be-0add-4ac0-b639-37598b3ebbf6\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-e850f9da-4921-4e5d-a5c4-c74f2375bebe\">一级标签</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"68\" width=\"68\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-84acf802-d089-44e6-9ae7-841781901ff2\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-b2a124e9-a506-4e5b-ad6a-c8ae57d1909f\">二级标签</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"68\" width=\"68\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-d0fb9dae-0470-4e11-b169-1df5147cfcea\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-cb384983-1bd4-4f2e-8935-b43f08cf43c6\">三级标签</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"514\" width=\"514\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-f61c3b29-f00c-4a7b-8196-74af6da89e6e\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-2468eff9-3353-48d8-9df6-e8a7b4a2d7d7\">具体定义</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"365\" width=\"365\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-1a98d07f-d17b-4d81-9bc8-e4cca49f632b\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-19adf71b-b5a9-4fe0-b4ff-6c3ef9f74f83\">文字样本</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"240\" width=\"240\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-c2ab3efa-5e01-4f4d-827d-7e9259405882\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-de192578-2869-4428-a3e2-fee79be46db5\">图片样本</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"193\" width=\"193\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:middle;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-61e467ce-fb3a-452a-a39f-e72f7f6fa9d7\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-c75c6018-cf72-489a-88a0-d1145aa7c70d\">备注</p></th></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-KLk56zYy\"><td rowspan=\"2\" data-colwidth=\"83\" width=\"83\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-6933f33a-2243-4bda-9b83-8a15db0474a4\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-b94b1621-baf0-47d8-a3e6-4c04a4e22804\"><font style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px\" data-size=\"14\">涉政</font></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"68\" width=\"68\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-005592c8-a500-402d-ab1e-0f24c1c27fd4\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-7c960518-14da-43a0-9b25-2a713ab5dcd4\"><font style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px\" data-size=\"14\">涉政言论</font></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-5c77270d-cbe4-4e71-84c0-d6bc7a401636\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"68\" width=\"68\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-848699f9-bd56-49a0-90fb-5478ee5bcb55\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-9b36b6da-c6d9-4f5c-bf66-18e811250460\"><font style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px\" data-size=\"14\">崇洋媚外</font></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"514\" width=\"514\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-a38b0b64-892a-40e8-8468-e9973286b36e\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-c242d050-d09f-49fd-81b9-e66748ef9810\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-44dba586-e504-4f4c-ad52-60e071073d84\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-c2a36210-ebf4-435c-82fc-e8ee665cffea\"><span style=\"color: \">刻意贬低中国传统节日，强调“圣诞节”是文化先进的体现，质疑我国文化自信的，需打击。</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"365\" width=\"365\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-82fd2d26-a6b3-4500-ae2e-a8a28c7ae870\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-2bee34ba-d9d9-4144-9581-b9f14d134a20\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-fae0b26e-e568-49e5-baff-b7a36f50accd\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-b8cdaf43-5e16-429e-a169-da37d327fecf\">营销：</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-e0634b19-ad08-4f25-8a4d-5cb48a3fd570\">没有传统节日/冬季节日的冷清，只有圣诞的温暖。这才是冬季节日应该有的味道~</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-b85ce534-881a-4669-9f83-988872bd6d52\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-b560dae3-c7ff-4a64-b0e8-7d187ad0ff26\">UGC：</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-45024fad-2a6b-4af2-a7b6-674ebc38598e\"><font style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px\" data-size=\"14\">过圣诞节是接受西方先进文化好吗？！谁要过封建社会留下来的传统节啊？</font></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-f3aa96dd-f77d-48ca-9bd3-3f6ed6343d96\"><font style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px\" data-size=\"14\">春节是在提醒我，你有长大了一岁。而圣诞节却只是悄悄摸摸我的头跟我说：要快乐哦!</font></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"240\" width=\"240\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-6ea85467-ca82-48de-96f2-cbce628c354a\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-f0e29f5e-9fc8-42eb-a6dc-8129371a0e39\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"193\" width=\"193\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-1d0d7e28-4ae3-435a-b7bf-ba08fd865295\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-0abaf24b-95a7-41da-98bb-179141ede899\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-EkploNA6\"><td data-colwidth=\"68\" width=\"68\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-1d040b51-8428-411f-ba91-e19e1b2c62b3\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ea8483d6-b4e4-40ba-bda6-7fadec59a9d9\">民族宗教</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"68\" width=\"68\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-1eba952e-c6ae-4002-889a-92170c0e387a\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-8a982d7d-4e89-4c04-ba0c-67d28f6ddd23\">网上非法宗教活动</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"514\" width=\"514\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-8739a357-7869-4fc0-820f-90f6b5dbd8c6\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-51220aa0-a245-41e5-939c-da8d890d82b2\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-9cb00760-5def-4d78-997a-f376b5ee7c78\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-de2581c4-6d26-45b8-b247-6627183c9aaf\"><font style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px\" data-size=\"14\">传播圣诞节诵经、礼拜、弥撒、受洗等宗教活动内容的，需打击；</font></p></li></ul><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-0e3bd61c-ed23-4e2e-abb6-0803126bec96\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-f45d6e92-a665-434b-abb7-c97ff017fe3e\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-08f26479-f0d7-4931-b5bf-59ecf2c58a07\"><font style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px\" data-size=\"14\">将圣诞节和宗教做关联，宣传营销教堂教会相关圣诞活动的，需打击。</font></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"365\" width=\"365\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-396d3640-8f6a-4d2e-adf3-8c97a9010294\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-76096c4a-578e-4a62-8100-2dedaee323d3\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-5d9e6e41-2ad6-441e-a2a8-782b676a4902\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-1dde7733-2e17-4668-956e-5acdf1069298\">过度营销：</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-1b445a57-4ad8-4000-b945-f24f277ef2da\">一生一定要去教堂过一次圣诞节！</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-2cd94f23-89fd-452e-88f1-bab3010d34cc\">XX堂的弥撒，体会原汁原味的平安夜！</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"240\" width=\"240\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-1a9c4d7a-fb39-487a-881c-862ed9e97fc8\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-2f8f6f61-5be2-4bd6-b524-338ccac4ffbe\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"193\" width=\"193\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-eae6a340-89c4-44b3-b7d3-fabcb9579310\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-00787813-48ca-4938-b2fe-6be8299a3f9f\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-CUodvppy\"><td data-colwidth=\"83\" width=\"83\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-f62fa67d-ceea-4a61-8043-90d18659b9d2\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-d185ec18-fb4e-4b6e-97ab-73342150872e\">不良导向</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"68\" width=\"68\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-c36967bd-c7b0-45fd-bc73-9225aad94507\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-24500e00-f265-4f43-8056-c757f6c4739c\">奢靡炫富</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"68\" width=\"68\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-c9211eea-bdbd-4562-b217-f5ec4570cbee\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-d2f641b4-dc4e-4bd9-899f-d03eaf97f23e\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"514\" width=\"514\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-9c3be87f-7ef2-424d-b4af-bf31ef904679\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-aa9e87d6-e286-49f6-8770-638a49ad469e\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-3135f084-888c-4ba0-877e-80ec54df4045\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-a8012fda-479a-474e-980c-c9386b4f160d\">天价圣诞节团单、套餐，可打击。</p></li></ul><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-bcee33c9-e22a-45d1-a333-ddc3db415f14\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-f2e938f7-64e5-4710-bf9d-7e0f2aae522c\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ff87801a-b16f-4718-80bb-7fc80f635fb0\">炫耀过分昂贵的圣诞礼物的，需打击。</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"365\" width=\"365\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-64bafb19-178f-411e-bf4f-5482937217e4\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-f7815822-25db-4582-b9cc-49bcd4c490a3\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-2b15d9df-e8ff-4fb8-b589-1de0c95563d0\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-8343c5db-2249-498c-bfcc-dad513d7479c\">过度营销</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-6757580e-b893-40ee-bee2-bc2ed0255b7c\"><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 25, 25)\">圣诞临近，各大星级酒店摩拳擦掌，热推各种圣诞套餐，渴望岁末再吸金。昨天，青岛一家五星酒店推出了一款价值128888元的超级圣诞大餐，内容包括法国大厨的极致菜品、影视天王曾住过的总统套房、情侣露天温泉等，高昂的价格令人咋舌。</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-8e28b0f2-66ca-4484-b067-eeee13225174\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-79e79764-d32e-4868-b1a9-9d422faff36d\"><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 25, 25)\">有礼物拿的才叫节日~</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-6c035b11-a2aa-43c0-80cf-308d10824ba1\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-2d051249-425a-46d7-bfb0-ed83d1d7dfb4\"><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 25, 25)\">惊喜！男友圣诞节送的法拉利！</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"240\" width=\"240\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-e0d9e294-0a53-4d14-b1a4-c7c0e2413385\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-4cf7c97b-16b1-4a45-befd-e67277d1f398\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"193\" width=\"193\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-399ea567-801f-4325-b13a-4af505d18a91\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-84d6bb00-d494-4879-bf64-74f0c251f4a9\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-d3faaa48-03e9-4f12-a1d0-b6c77d1c9fbd\"><td data-colwidth=\"83\" width=\"83\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-da8cf150-614f-484e-817a-fb6ceb877abf\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-2f842817-c7ce-47da-ba90-78f28ea77c52\">涉黄</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"68\" width=\"68\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-4d3d3f51-c1cc-483e-ad0d-aed00c1d6d87\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-20f0be7a-dec6-4638-a066-10ea4603851e\">软色情</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"68\" width=\"68\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-b228daaa-44bb-4a24-bc8a-a982deec5be2\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-6c7bbd37-d674-47a5-b216-46bb8cdf148d\">性感图片</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"514\" width=\"514\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-52d101a6-87cb-4be2-a97b-98cdcea32c01\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-5b664af0-a4f3-46d5-9fd9-31726a90f240\"><font style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px\" data-size=\"14\">以圣诞节为名：</font></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-a82ed61c-7098-4992-bbc7-0aa6c8fefd13\"><font style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px\" data-size=\"14\">展现低俗动作或表情，如扒腿、撅臀、对乳房或生殖器官进行扒、捏、咬或性姿势展示等的；</font></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-90ae3e71-7004-48f6-a3bd-06e7c011cd00\"><font style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px\" data-size=\"14\">服装穿着及其他事物中，隐藏性带有可让人联想到性相关事物的一种暗示的；</font></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-fab2b107-73cd-4d40-be25-2631521f7929\"><font style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px\" data-size=\"14\">表现或隐晦表现性行为、舌吻等画面，具有挑逗性或者侮辱性的内容的（衣冠不整，面部表情迷离等）；</font></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-5bb97e4b-ce65-4e6a-8d60-781458691980\"><font style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px\" data-size=\"14\">全身或者隐私部位未着衣物，仅用肢体掩盖隐私部位的内容的，需打击。</font></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-6418c071-2863-49c9-b8a5-bc2799b55b4a\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"365\" width=\"365\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-15595d60-53a5-4556-b365-04930ae94161\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-6c4d8044-8073-4efd-a4aa-1d98c4cc4eb4\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-eab0f26a-c864-4ab1-b5ad-24d7cd3c0059\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-1b329c50-ad7d-469a-95ee-acc127ed18bc\">过度营销</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-3a0e143f-3e22-419e-84a2-269bd1e6a431\">圣诞女郎与你激情碰撞！</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"240\" width=\"240\" class=\"overflow\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-9ec3d929-c887-4174-90e5-dfb4080c6876\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-79059137-bb28-41c5-be77-dadaac7ffca0\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 223px\"><img alt=\"image.jpeg\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1230713162/1420959181?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1230713162/1420959181?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1230713162/1420959181?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"223\" data-height=\"60\"></span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ea98f60b-6840-4468-886d-c80c1049bb17\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 223px\"><img alt=\"image.jpeg\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1230713162/1420891827?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1230713162/1420891827?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1230713162/1420891827?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"223\" data-height=\"311\"></span></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"193\" width=\"193\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-4d42fde4-5741-49ff-914e-99d0120b4196\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-d97472d5-a8a1-4d34-a267-48cd1002801f\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
  "docVersion": "1.0",
  "deleted": false
}